WEBVTT

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.210
(Love In Sync)

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.520
(Kim Myung Soo)

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.190
(Kang Min Ah)

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.080
(Love In Sync)

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.989
(All people, incidents, and backgrounds...)

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:49.119
(in this drama are fictitious and unrelated to reality.)

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.320
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.400
Ji An.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:03.870
Are you okay?

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:30.830
Why are you out here in the cold?

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:37.140
Is something wrong?

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:43.480
Are you okay?

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.080
Are you hurt?

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:49.550
Then what is wrong?

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:52.050
I'm sorry.

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:53.820
I'm sorry.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.560
What is it? What's wrong?

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:02.830
Tell me.

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:27.950
How did you end up in a place like this?

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:34.130
I wasn't expecting a tearful reunion,

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:36.230
But still,

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:39.030
I wasn't expecting to be treated this coldly.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:44.100
Aren't you even curious how I've been all this time?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.240
Have you...

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:49.670
Been well?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.310
How could I have been?

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.110
A child can leave the nest and live well,

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:56.550
But a parent...

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.120
Can't do that so easily.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:01.950
Can you still...

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.820
Not be alone when it rains?

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:09.290
It started after that accident when you were a child, right?

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:12.960
You started trembling every time it rained.

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:16.000
Because of you, even when I was in the US,

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.700
Whenever I heard it was raining in Korea,

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.140
I would get so worried.

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:22.370
You...

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:26.510
Will never understand how a mother feels.

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:30.980
The person who saved me from that accident...

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:36.050
Was it really you?

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:42.260
Kiddo, stay with me. Kiddo.

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:48.630
Sweetie, are you awake?

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:53.370
Thank goodness.

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.310
My baby.

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:58.940
Mommy was so worried.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:00.710
What about the man?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:02.380
A man?

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:06.220
A man saved me.

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:07.950
He promised he would save me.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.890
My poor baby, you must have been dreaming.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:15.430
- No, I saw him. - It was me.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:18.700
I'm the one who found you, Ji An.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:23.130
You were the one who saved me?

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:26.600
Of course. I'm your mother.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:28.440
If it wasn't me...

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:30.380
Besides me, your mother,

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.210
Who would risk their life for you?

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:36.380
Right?

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:38.720
You're lying.

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:41.390
How long were you going to lie to me?

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:44.060
You weren't the one who saved me that day.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:48.160
So you remember it all.

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:51.900
Why did you lie about it?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.570
- Why? - It was for you.

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:57.640
Not for yourself?

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:01.170
To a seven-year-old child,

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:05.080
How could I say that someone died trying to save you?

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.610
Especially when...

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.450
The accident happened because of you.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.120
Hey, kid,

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:16.520
This is a very dangerous scene to film.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.960
- It's not that simple... - I still want to do it.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.730
I can do it.

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:25.260
If you hadn't been so stubborn that day,

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.700
The accident wouldn't have happened,

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:31.540
And that man wouldn't have died saving you.

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:35.540
But what mother in the world...

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:39.280
Could tell her own child such a cruel truth?

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.690
That man, Cha Eun Hwan...

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.630
He doesn't know about this yet, does he?

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:58.660
Good.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.770
He must never find out.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:05.140
How devastated would he be?

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:10.310
His own father died because of you.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.190
My daughter,

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:32.860
It has been hard for you without me, hasn't it?

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:37.170
You do not have to worry anymore.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:41.110
Your mother is here now.

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:55.150
("Yu Ji An is Under 1-Person Agency,")

00:06:55.151 --> 00:06:56.650
("And Her Mother Will Be The CEO To Manage All Activities")

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.160
That is absolutely out of the question.

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:06.460
And why is that?

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:09.400
A film has a set story.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:10.869
You think one can just change screen time...

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:13.040
To suit their own tastes?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.610
Why not?

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.140
You think of this film...

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.210
As a work of art, don't you, Director?

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:23.410
But art is only art if it sells.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.080
If it does not sell, what is it but trash?

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:27.520
Listen here, Yu Ji An's mother.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:31.160
Let's think about this rationally.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.760
In the current situation, whose name...

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:37.130
Will help make this film a box office hit?

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.600
Han Yi Jin's first-ever leading role?

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:47.170
Or Yu Ji An's first comeback after her scandal?

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:57.050
- It would be Yu Ji An, wouldn't it? - Director Kang.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:08:00.590
Come on, it is a fact.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.320
The answer is already right there.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:05.590
Why is he struggling with it so much?

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.189
Surely you are not using...

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.460
Other people's money for your art...

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:13.600
Just to satisfy your own ego, are you?

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:15.300
I cannot give you much time.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.239
Let me know by tomorrow whether you...

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.870
Are going to increase our Ji An's screen time...

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:20.670
Or not.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.410
Ha Yul's mom, you have a visitor.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.250
Who is it?

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:50.740
Ji An, where are you?

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.000
Why are you not answering your phone?

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:53.970
I had something to take care of.

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:56.470
Why? Is something wrong?

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:01.310
How could you do this without even discussing it with me?

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.450
Why would I need to discuss it with you?

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.390
The outcome would have been the same even if I had discussed it.

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:12.020
This is Yi Jin's first leading role in the ten years since her debut.

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.690
- But to do this... - What business is that of yours?

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:21.670
Who on earth ruined you like this while I was gone?

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.400
I told you, didn't I?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.540
Once your status is set, it is hard to change.

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:29.510
After everything I have done to get you to this point,

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:33.110
You are going to play second fiddle to the likes of Yi Jin?

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.450
Listen carefully.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.119
If you want to live the rest of your life...

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.450
As the top star Yu Ji An,

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:45.420
Stop caring about what other people feel.

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:50.230
Only think about yourself.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:54.900
Everyone else is just your competition.

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:18.660
Hey, Yi Jin.

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.160
I heard from Director Kang.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:24.860
This again? It is always the same with you.

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:28.330
- This is a misunderstanding... - A misunderstanding?

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.270
What misunderstanding?

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:35.110
You were always like this, even when we were idols.

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:37.980
If there was anything even slightly good,

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:39.740
Be it an outfit, a song, or an opportunity,

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.250
You always snatched it away.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.520
I thought you had changed a little, but...

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.520
I guess people do not change that easily, do they?

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:55.890
The money I gave Mi Jeong was really for her hospital bills.

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:57.530
The reason I was in touch with her...

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.130
Was because I was trying to persuade her somehow.

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.600
And as for what happened with the CEO Noh...

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:04.740
You are right.

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:07.740
- I did it on purpose to screw you. - Han Yi Jin.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:13.810
You always take what is mine without a second thought.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:18.650
I absolutely despised you for it.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:22.190
I wish you would just...

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:25.990
Disappear from my life.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:36.730
(Establishing the Rule of Law)

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:43.770
(Establishing the Rule of Law)

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:51.420
(J.An Entertainment)

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.150
(Ministry of Law)

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:56.120
(Kim Jun Sik)

00:11:58.390 --> 00:11:59.459
("Yu Ji An is Under 1-Person Agency,")

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:00.519
("And Her Mother Will Be The CEO To Manage All Activities")

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:02.490
("Actress Yu Ji An Will Start Her Activities...")

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.100
A long-term exclusive contract?

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:12.800
You can't let that child dictate things forever.

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.670
If you do this one thing for me,

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:18.710
I'll entrust her entire management to you...

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:22.380
For the rest of Ji An's career in this industry.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.580
You know how she is.

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:27.990
If I tell Ji An to die,

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.220
She's the kind of girl who would even pretend to.

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:33.790
So what are you asking to do?

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:37.190
To give you what you want,

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:39.930
I have to get what I want first.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:42.870
Whatever it takes...

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.870
Make Ji An come back to me.

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:48.569
She lures in me minding my own business,

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:49.940
And makes a fool out of me.

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.610
And she thinks she can get a happy ending all by herself?

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:55.080
That would just be unfair to me.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:03.690
Have you been well?

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:06.820
It's been a while, Mr. Cha. What brings you here?

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.330
I was wondering how Seon Woo was doing,

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.030
So I thought I'd stop by.

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:14.060
Please have a seat.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:20.640
But I have a feeling Seon Woo is just an excuse,

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:24.610
And that you're really here to ask about someone else.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.010
Is she doing all right?

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:33.879
Actually, I was just about to contact you...

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:35.590
About Ji An, Mr. Cha.

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:37.890
Is something wrong?

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.690
Something's off with Ji An.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:46.700
She can't focus on set,

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.470
And her emotional scenes aren't what they used to be.

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:50.800
More than anything...

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.040
She seems very fragile.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:56.810
To be honest,

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.310
Because of the recent issue with her mother,

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.910
I wasn't feeling too great about Ji An either,

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:03.480
But now I just feel sorry for her.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:08.150
I'm worried something might happen to her if she keeps this up.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.290
I'm afraid.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.530
I'm afraid she'll show up again and ruin my life.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.070
I'm afraid I'll go back as the person I was.

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:37.650
- Hello. - Hello.

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:09.810
Of course.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.420
There's no way he would be here.

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:23.590
(CEO Kim)

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:28.670
What's this about?

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:32.840
What?

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:34.610
What do you mean...

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:37.640
I heard you took good care of my Ji An...

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:41.410
By being her manager while I was gone.

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:43.450
As her mother, I'm grateful.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:45.720
Not at all.

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:49.620
But you're not her manager anymore.

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:51.890
What I'm saying is...

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:53.960
Please refrain from actions...

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:56.190
That could give people the wrong idea,

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:57.900
Like what you did earlier.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.930
She just made her comeback.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.900
It wouldn't be good for a scandal, would it?

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.440
Do you understand what I'm saying?

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:10.240
It seemed like Ji An was having a very hard time.

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:12.810
I appreciate your concern for my daughter,

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:16.250
But I'm here now, so stay out of it.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.520
I'm afraid I can't do that.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.420
I may not be her manager anymore,

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:29.590
But I am Yu Ji An's designated counsellor.

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:33.029
As a professional, I believe Ji An's condition...

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:35.170
Is not something I can ignore.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:39.570
So I plan on taking a very active interest from now on.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.080
You're just like your father.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:49.610
Starting with your looks,

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:52.949
All the way to your arrogant meddling...

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:54.020
In others' business.

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:59.490
Don't worry. Ji An doesn't know anything.

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:03.830
And of course, she should never find out.

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:05.900
If she were to find out,

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:08.430
There's no telling what she might do.

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:11.570
As her counsellor, you must know.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.800
That she's more fragile than she appears.

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:17.070
In the past, she tried to hurt herself...

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.010
Over something trivial.

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:22.510
She's that fragile.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:24.920
If she finds out this secret,

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:27.520
What she might do...

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:30.790
Is painfully obvious, isn't it?

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:35.760
You seem like a smart man,

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:42.630
So I trust you understand what I mean.

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:02.090
I told you about this ahead of time.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.220
No, that's not it.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.290
I'm not trying to change the concept.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:08.830
Let's stick to the storyboard. But look. Look at the lighting.

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:10.729
- It's so plain. - No, the studio...

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.259
Director, if you want to elevate this,

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:13.330
Please just listen to me.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.330
If we add a bit more detail to the lighting...

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.130
Where have you been all this time?

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:19.270
I believe I told you I wasn't coming back here.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:22.270
But you're here now. You came here on your own.

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:24.440
I had no other choice.

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:27.510
- I wonder why that is. - Cut.

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:31.680
Hey, Ji An. About your acting...

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:36.420
Let's take a quick break.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:22.830
If you keep giving us this kind of schedule...

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:24.269
You mean, she has to focus on the filming all week...

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:25.300
Once again in the second week of this month.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:28.540
She'll be busy then, reviewing offers for a new project.

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:29.810
You ask for more screen time, but then say...

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:31.170
It's hard to cooperate with the filming schedule.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:32.740
So what exactly do you expect me to do?

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.410
Why are you getting so upset?

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:36.579
We've already been considerate. This all happened because...

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:38.420
We had to revise the script to give her more screen time.

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:39.920
How much more accommodating do you want us to be?

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:42.220
- No. - I'll do it.

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:46.190
I said I'll do it. So both of you, please get out.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:50.330
- Ji An. - I said I'll do it. Everyone stop.

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:53.630
Let's go.

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:08.010
("Yu Ji An's Another Abuse of Power Controversy Even After Comeback")

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.950
(If this keeps happening, maybe it's just her personality?)

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:13.450
(Don't the staff's stories seem more credible?)

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:02.970
("Yu Ji An's Another Abuse of Power Controversy Even After Comeback")

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:29.660
Mr. Cha.

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:32.130
Ji An...

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:34.260
I can't get in touch with her.

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.440
She's not on the second floor either.

00:21:40.441 --> 00:21:41.740
This is driving me crazy.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:55.050
Where could she have gone without her phone?

00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:58.420
- When did you last hear from her? - Probably yesterday.

00:21:58.620 --> 00:22:00.260
Then why are you only looking for her now?

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:02.990
I just thought she needed time alone to clear her head.

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:04.900
She's been through a lot lately.

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:06.900
Is there any place she might have gone?

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:08.970
She's always either at home or on set.

00:22:12.140 --> 00:22:13.170
Don't tell me...

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:16.140
She's not thinking of doing something bad again, is she?

00:22:16.840 --> 00:22:18.910
She was just like this before that happened.

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:23.650
Where are you going?

00:22:25.450 --> 00:22:27.750
Something's off about Ji An.

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:30.620
She seems very fragile.

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:32.489
I'm starting to feel sorry for her.

00:22:32.490 --> 00:22:35.460
I'm worried something might happen to her.

00:22:35.590 --> 00:22:36.960
(1 dollar)

00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:40.230
As her counsellor, you must know.

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:42.700
That she's more fragile than she appears.

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:47.540
In the past, she tried to hurt herself over something trivial.

00:22:51.980 --> 00:22:52.980
(1 dollar)

00:22:52.980 --> 00:22:53.980
Don't tell me...

00:22:54.780 --> 00:22:56.450
She's not thinking of doing something bad again, is she?

00:22:57.450 --> 00:22:59.580
She was just like this before that happened.

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:07.660
Yu Ji An.

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:09.590
Where in the world are you?

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:12.530
Please.

00:23:14.100 --> 00:23:15.130
Please.

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:22.310
Actress Yu Ji An, who recently made...

00:23:22.370 --> 00:23:25.340
A comeback after overcoming an abuse of power controversy,

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:27.880
Is now embroiled in rumours that she has gone into hiding.

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:30.109
Reports say she has cancelled all her appointments...

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:32.780
And suddenly disappeared.

00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:35.950
Her agency has issued a full denial,

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:38.520
Claiming it is for health reasons.

00:23:38.820 --> 00:23:41.559
However, due to recent false accusations...

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:43.160
And a series of incidents involving her,

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:45.600
There is growing concern for her safety...

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:48.870
On social media and in fan communities.

00:23:49.500 --> 00:23:52.670
Does Eun Hwan know that you found out?

00:23:55.310 --> 00:23:56.470
Not yet.

00:23:57.210 --> 00:23:58.310
Good.

00:23:58.940 --> 00:24:00.180
If you feel so sorry,

00:24:01.110 --> 00:24:02.410
Then leave Eun Hwan.

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:06.220
You two can never be together.

00:24:08.390 --> 00:24:10.490
I don't think I need to tell you that anymore.

00:24:11.820 --> 00:24:13.290
I don't want Eun Hwan...

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:16.830
To be hurt by that accident in any way.

00:24:19.960 --> 00:24:21.460
You know what I mean, right?

00:24:29.570 --> 00:24:31.240
Hey, hey. Did you see the news?

00:24:31.540 --> 00:24:32.980
Did Yu Ji An really disappear?

00:24:33.180 --> 00:24:35.710
Hey, disappearing would be better. What if it's...

00:24:35.780 --> 00:24:38.720
Hey, watch what you say. It can't be that, right?

00:24:38.780 --> 00:24:40.450
Anyway, the two of them fought a lot.

00:24:40.680 --> 00:24:42.150
That's right. I heard that too.

00:24:42.890 --> 00:24:44.990
Didn't she say she wished she would just disappear?

00:24:45.920 --> 00:24:46.990
I wish you would just...

00:24:47.590 --> 00:24:49.830
Disappear from my life.

00:24:50.330 --> 00:24:51.390
It was really harsh.

00:24:51.460 --> 00:24:53.160
Hey, let's not just speculate among ourselves.

00:24:53.260 --> 00:24:54.760
Right. It can't be that.

00:24:56.300 --> 00:24:57.630
If it is, that would be crazy.

00:25:04.840 --> 00:25:07.080
Stop drinking. You're going to ruin your health.

00:25:10.080 --> 00:25:11.720
I think I'm being punished.

00:25:12.120 --> 00:25:13.120
You idiot.

00:25:14.150 --> 00:25:15.450
What do you have to be punished for?

00:25:16.020 --> 00:25:17.820
I made her cry too often.

00:25:19.490 --> 00:25:20.860
That beautiful woman.

00:25:22.760 --> 00:25:24.160
When I think about it,

00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:27.730
I never really gave her anything.

00:25:31.200 --> 00:25:32.540
I always held back.

00:25:34.840 --> 00:25:37.870
I always held back expressing my feelings and smiling.

00:25:44.180 --> 00:25:46.280
I was afraid that I might get too greedy.

00:25:47.820 --> 00:25:49.650
I was also afraid I wouldn't be able to handle myself.

00:25:52.190 --> 00:25:54.760
So I always kept my distance.

00:25:58.500 --> 00:25:59.560
And that always...

00:26:03.270 --> 00:26:04.430
Made her cry.

00:26:10.270 --> 00:26:12.040
If I had known I'd regret it this much,

00:26:14.710 --> 00:26:16.410
I should have given her everything instead of holding back.

00:26:17.450 --> 00:26:18.720
I'm sure she's okay.

00:26:21.120 --> 00:26:22.150
Don't worry.

00:26:23.020 --> 00:26:24.590
I will find her no matter what.

00:26:26.120 --> 00:26:27.120
I'll find her,

00:26:29.890 --> 00:26:30.990
And this time,

00:26:35.130 --> 00:26:36.400
I'll protect her for sure.

00:26:49.110 --> 00:26:51.010
(Let's eat Americano after getting an attendance stamp.)

00:27:04.030 --> 00:27:09.170
(1 dollar)

00:27:15.040 --> 00:27:17.370
- You're not hurt? - No.

00:27:18.380 --> 00:27:19.580
Then I'm glad about that.

00:27:42.400 --> 00:27:45.500
Right now, I'm about to do the most selfish thing...

00:27:45.570 --> 00:27:46.800
In my life.

00:28:08.830 --> 00:28:12.130
(Scene in the Police Station, Day)

00:28:23.270 --> 00:28:27.610
(Scene in the House, Night)

00:28:31.210 --> 00:28:33.249
I'm afraid.

00:28:33.250 --> 00:28:35.690
I'm afraid she'll show up again and ruin my life.

00:28:36.220 --> 00:28:37.890
I'm afraid I'll go back as the person I was.

00:28:38.690 --> 00:28:39.760
If that happens,

00:28:41.190 --> 00:28:42.490
I'll protect you.

00:28:44.090 --> 00:28:45.260
I was wrong.

00:28:48.200 --> 00:28:49.300
So please...

00:28:52.370 --> 00:28:54.540
Please stop torturing me and just show up.

00:28:58.270 --> 00:28:59.710
If you just show up,

00:29:03.350 --> 00:29:05.120
I'll keep my promise this time.

00:29:09.650 --> 00:29:10.650
Please.

00:29:20.100 --> 00:29:21.400
(Woo Dong Gyeong)

00:29:29.270 --> 00:29:30.670
(Woo Dong Gyeong)

00:29:32.080 --> 00:29:33.880
- Hello. - Hey, I remember now.

00:29:34.480 --> 00:29:35.510
It's the fishing spot.

00:29:40.050 --> 00:29:43.390
Dong Gyeong, do you know where that is?

00:29:43.790 --> 00:29:44.790
Where?

00:29:45.690 --> 00:29:47.360
The place where Eun Hwan ran off to.

00:29:48.320 --> 00:29:49.730
I was the one who told her about it.

00:29:52.300 --> 00:29:53.530
Why are you just telling me this now?

00:30:34.070 --> 00:30:35.070
Eun Hwan?

00:30:41.410 --> 00:30:43.310
How did you know I was here?

00:30:44.550 --> 00:30:46.250
This is the best place you could run away to?

00:30:47.050 --> 00:30:48.320
How anticlimactic.

00:30:49.950 --> 00:30:52.590
I was ready to find you at the ends of the earth.

00:30:57.560 --> 00:30:58.930
You missed me a lot, didn't you?

00:31:02.630 --> 00:31:03.630
You're lying.

00:31:07.370 --> 00:31:09.470
I really missed you.

00:31:22.290 --> 00:31:23.420
I'm sorry for leaving you alone.

00:31:30.030 --> 00:31:31.230
I'm also sorry for not protecting you.

00:31:33.760 --> 00:31:34.760
I'm really...

00:31:37.030 --> 00:31:38.170
I'm so sorry.

00:32:03.630 --> 00:32:05.759
(Receipt)

00:32:05.760 --> 00:32:07.200
This is for one week's stay?

00:32:08.060 --> 00:32:10.570
No way. It's not like this is a hotel suite.

00:32:10.630 --> 00:32:11.730
Tell me about it.

00:32:12.370 --> 00:32:16.210
She comes to a guesthouse in the countryside and what? What?

00:32:16.270 --> 00:32:17.839
- What? - How many times...

00:32:17.840 --> 00:32:18.840
Do I have to say it, ma'am?

00:32:19.580 --> 00:32:20.580
Amenities.

00:32:20.610 --> 00:32:21.639
Gosh.

00:32:21.640 --> 00:32:23.509
Anyway, amenities or whatever.

00:32:23.510 --> 00:32:25.150
I've never met anyone looking for things like that.

00:32:25.520 --> 00:32:26.520
Not only that,

00:32:26.580 --> 00:32:29.620
She showed up without a penny to her name.

00:32:29.690 --> 00:32:32.290
Including food and clothes, she owes me over 1,000 dollars.

00:32:36.490 --> 00:32:39.900
Don't you know it costs a lot to maintain a star's image?

00:32:46.440 --> 00:32:49.910
- What was that? - What? What did I do?

00:32:50.210 --> 00:32:52.580
I think you just thought, "Did I make a mistake coming here?"

00:32:52.640 --> 00:32:55.580
- I felt it. - No, that's ridiculous...

00:32:55.650 --> 00:32:56.949
You said you were sorry,

00:32:56.950 --> 00:32:58.750
But now you're being so petty about money.

00:32:59.580 --> 00:33:00.680
I'm telling you, that's not it.

00:33:00.820 --> 00:33:02.390
You just thought that a second ago.

00:33:02.450 --> 00:33:04.020
That's absolutely not true. This is so unfair.

00:33:04.120 --> 00:33:05.359
That's not it. Why would I think like that?

00:33:05.360 --> 00:33:06.690
If you think it's a waste, then just leave.

00:33:06.760 --> 00:33:08.760
Why would I leave? I came here for you, Ji An.

00:33:08.830 --> 00:33:10.160
Then pay for it.

00:33:14.100 --> 00:33:15.529
Why did you run away to a fishing spot...

00:33:15.530 --> 00:33:16.830
Despite you can't even fish?

00:33:17.530 --> 00:33:21.040
I just wanted to run away,

00:33:22.240 --> 00:33:23.540
But I didn't know where to go.

00:33:25.780 --> 00:33:28.440
And I was also curious about a place you had memories of.

00:33:30.480 --> 00:33:31.610
Have things been hard for you?

00:33:33.450 --> 00:33:34.480
It was my mom.

00:33:36.090 --> 00:33:38.520
She's the one who put CEO Kim up to the abuse of power controversy.

00:33:43.230 --> 00:33:45.760
I know, right? Shocking, isn't it?

00:33:48.430 --> 00:33:50.300
I couldn't believe it when I heard it.

00:33:55.510 --> 00:33:56.510
Are you okay?

00:34:04.550 --> 00:34:05.980
She must have thought I'd come running back to her...

00:34:09.790 --> 00:34:12.560
If I was struggling.

00:34:14.260 --> 00:34:15.390
But too bad for her.

00:34:16.690 --> 00:34:18.160
Because now,

00:34:20.000 --> 00:34:22.270
I don't think I can put up with her anymore.

00:34:29.010 --> 00:34:30.040
This time...

00:34:32.880 --> 00:34:34.410
I'll be right by your side.

00:34:48.790 --> 00:34:49.790
(Contract Termination Notice)

00:34:49.790 --> 00:34:50.790
(Reason: Breach of Trust)

00:34:50.930 --> 00:34:51.930
What is this?

00:34:52.330 --> 00:34:53.330
It's exactly what it looks like.

00:34:54.030 --> 00:34:56.330
I'm terminating all contracts between you and me.

00:34:57.670 --> 00:35:01.240
From now on, you have no rights over me.

00:35:02.340 --> 00:35:03.670
You're still acting like a child.

00:35:04.870 --> 00:35:07.680
If you're having such a hard time, take a few more days off.

00:35:08.810 --> 00:35:10.310
I'll take care of your schedule...

00:35:10.410 --> 00:35:13.820
Soon, I'll be filing a lawsuit to nullify the contracts...

00:35:14.180 --> 00:35:16.550
- you signed without my consent. - You little...

00:35:18.990 --> 00:35:22.560
Are you saying you're fine with Cha Eun Hwan finding out the truth?

00:35:25.230 --> 00:35:26.930
Is it okay if he knows about why his father died...

00:35:27.200 --> 00:35:30.430
And who was responsible for his death?

00:35:31.330 --> 00:35:35.000
Do you really think I wouldn't remember anything?

00:35:37.840 --> 00:35:39.310
What's there to be scared of?

00:35:40.010 --> 00:35:43.610
Just go inside the storage room for a little while.

00:35:44.410 --> 00:35:46.880
They said you can be the protagonist.

00:35:47.350 --> 00:35:49.590
But I'm still scared.

00:35:53.020 --> 00:35:55.830
You don't want to live with me?

00:35:59.200 --> 00:36:04.000
Ji An, if we want to live together, we need a house.

00:36:07.670 --> 00:36:08.670
You can do it, right?

00:36:22.080 --> 00:36:23.090
Let's go.

00:36:23.590 --> 00:36:25.319
A while ago, CEO Kim sent me something...

00:36:25.320 --> 00:36:27.220
As an apology gift.

00:36:29.430 --> 00:36:30.430
Do you want to hear it?

00:36:32.400 --> 00:36:33.530
(Call Recording)

00:36:33.600 --> 00:36:35.670
To give you what you want,

00:36:36.500 --> 00:36:38.970
I have to get what I want first.

00:36:39.570 --> 00:36:41.739
- How... - She has to learn...

00:36:41.740 --> 00:36:43.270
How tough it is,

00:36:43.810 --> 00:36:45.370
So she'll miss my embrace, don't you think?

00:36:45.810 --> 00:36:48.880
Push Ji An to rock bottom.

00:36:49.710 --> 00:36:51.350
As far as you possibly can.

00:36:55.950 --> 00:37:00.490
Ji An, this is all fabricated.

00:37:00.620 --> 00:37:04.190
- Like you did to me? - Me? It was for your own good.

00:37:05.600 --> 00:37:08.000
In order to protect you, I had to...

00:37:09.800 --> 00:37:11.000
Keep you by my side.

00:37:11.430 --> 00:37:13.600
No parent would destroy their own child...

00:37:14.340 --> 00:37:15.640
In order to protect them.

00:37:18.570 --> 00:37:19.680
Ji An.

00:37:21.210 --> 00:37:22.210
I...

00:37:23.850 --> 00:37:25.780
- I did it for... - I will no longer...

00:37:27.180 --> 00:37:28.720
Destroy myself...

00:37:31.250 --> 00:37:32.820
Just to be loved by you.

00:37:53.140 --> 00:37:54.140
Are you okay?

00:39:12.790 --> 00:39:13.920
She probably left him...

00:39:15.090 --> 00:39:16.330
Because she loved him.

00:39:29.970 --> 00:39:31.040
You're awake?

00:39:32.980 --> 00:39:34.840
How are you feeling?

00:39:38.380 --> 00:39:41.080
Will you go somewhere with me?

00:39:43.150 --> 00:39:46.159
(The Late Cha Woo Seok)

00:39:46.160 --> 00:39:50.930
(The Late Cha Woo Seok)

00:39:57.530 --> 00:39:59.239
If you get scared or feel like you're in danger,

00:39:59.240 --> 00:40:00.740
Just scream for help.

00:40:01.440 --> 00:40:05.070
And I'll come running like Superman to save you.

00:40:05.410 --> 00:40:06.410
Got it?

00:40:09.080 --> 00:40:10.810
I'm so sorry it took me so long to come.

00:40:11.810 --> 00:40:12.820
Sir.

00:40:16.250 --> 00:40:17.990
How long have you known?

00:40:19.690 --> 00:40:20.960
Not for long.

00:40:22.120 --> 00:40:26.000
My memory came back on that last rainy day.

00:40:26.760 --> 00:40:28.730
Then why didn't you say anything?

00:40:31.070 --> 00:40:33.240
Because I thought if you knew that I knew,

00:40:34.300 --> 00:40:36.410
It would be too hard on you, Eun Hwan.

00:40:42.280 --> 00:40:43.410
I've grown up a lot, haven't I?

00:40:47.080 --> 00:40:48.080
Why...

00:40:49.020 --> 00:40:50.620
Didn't you hate me?

00:40:52.720 --> 00:40:54.190
If it hadn't been for me,

00:40:54.960 --> 00:40:56.430
Your father...

00:40:58.360 --> 00:40:59.360
And sister...

00:41:02.700 --> 00:41:04.400
Wouldn't have ended up that way.

00:41:05.470 --> 00:41:06.940
How could I hate you?

00:41:09.840 --> 00:41:11.810
Even when you couldn't remember anything,

00:41:13.580 --> 00:41:16.150
You could never let go of the guilt...

00:41:17.650 --> 00:41:18.880
And were always in pain.

00:41:20.280 --> 00:41:21.750
My heart always went out to you.

00:41:23.550 --> 00:41:24.550
So,

00:41:25.290 --> 00:41:27.020
You don't have to feel sorry anymore.

00:41:28.060 --> 00:41:29.230
That incident was...

00:41:30.630 --> 00:41:32.160
No one's...

00:41:32.730 --> 00:41:33.900
Fault.

00:41:34.800 --> 00:41:36.270
It was just an accident.

00:41:38.730 --> 00:41:39.870
My father...

00:41:41.170 --> 00:41:43.940
Wouldn't want you to suffer like this either, Ji An.

00:41:47.540 --> 00:41:48.710
You can do that for me, can't you?

00:41:54.880 --> 00:41:55.890
We...

00:41:57.620 --> 00:41:58.720
Can't be together, can we?

00:42:10.830 --> 00:42:12.100
Still, I'm glad...

00:42:14.070 --> 00:42:16.470
That we can say goodbye in such a beautiful place.

00:42:22.680 --> 00:42:23.710
Thank you.

00:42:25.180 --> 00:42:26.250
Thanks to you,

00:42:27.550 --> 00:42:29.450
I learned how to understand someone...

00:42:33.190 --> 00:42:34.820
And how to love someone.

00:42:40.330 --> 00:42:41.500
Thank you too...

00:42:43.230 --> 00:42:44.700
For coming into my life...

00:42:46.640 --> 00:42:49.510
And letting me know how brightly...

00:42:52.170 --> 00:42:53.310
I could smile.

00:43:23.840 --> 00:43:27.580
(1 Year Later)

00:43:30.610 --> 00:43:31.710
(Best Supporting Actress: Yu Ji An)

00:43:31.780 --> 00:43:33.150
(March Individual Brand Reputation: Number 1)

00:43:33.220 --> 00:43:34.950
("Yu Ji An, Best Supporting Actress at Yeongjong Film Awards")

00:43:37.320 --> 00:43:38.490
(Only Yu Ji An could play Jung In.)

00:43:38.550 --> 00:43:39.790
(She deserves this.)

00:43:41.860 --> 00:43:42.860
Yes.

00:43:43.830 --> 00:43:45.759
Mr. Cha, it's almost time for your lecture.

00:43:45.760 --> 00:43:47.600
Oh, yes.

00:43:53.700 --> 00:43:55.140
(What is "Empathy?")

00:43:55.200 --> 00:43:56.740
(About True Empathy in This Era)

00:43:57.310 --> 00:43:58.310
Everyone,

00:43:58.940 --> 00:44:00.240
What is empathy?

00:44:01.680 --> 00:44:05.280
When we say we're empathizing, we often try to explain things...

00:44:05.680 --> 00:44:06.880
Or solve the problem.

00:44:07.720 --> 00:44:09.150
But that's not what empathy is.

00:44:10.220 --> 00:44:13.660
It's something you can feel just by being there for someone.

00:44:14.120 --> 00:44:17.630
The foundation of my method acting is empathy.

00:44:18.260 --> 00:44:20.029
If you don't understand the character's feelings...

00:44:20.030 --> 00:44:22.360
And just go through the motions,

00:44:23.300 --> 00:44:24.730
That's an insult to the acting.

00:44:25.930 --> 00:44:28.370
You saw how my acting improved overnight, didn't you?

00:44:29.170 --> 00:44:33.240
What's the secret? Repeat after me. Empathy.

00:44:33.810 --> 00:44:34.810
Empathy.

00:44:35.140 --> 00:44:37.680
That's right. You have to act with your heart.

00:44:38.180 --> 00:44:39.180
Empathy.

00:44:44.590 --> 00:44:46.390
Why won't anyone believe me?

00:44:47.520 --> 00:44:49.790
I know. I know...

00:44:50.390 --> 00:44:51.630
What I did was wrong.

00:44:52.560 --> 00:44:54.300
I only did it because I was so scared that day.

00:44:54.760 --> 00:44:56.170
Just once,

00:44:56.770 --> 00:45:00.200
Couldn't you try to understand how I was feeling?

00:45:02.600 --> 00:45:03.610
Ha Yul.

00:45:05.740 --> 00:45:06.780
Mom.

00:45:09.880 --> 00:45:12.110
- Have you been having fun? - Yes.

00:45:12.180 --> 00:45:14.080
Did you go on the slide a lot? How many times?

00:45:14.750 --> 00:45:16.720
- Hello. Here you are. - Thank you.

00:45:16.790 --> 00:45:18.090
You can go up to the second floor now.

00:45:18.150 --> 00:45:19.890
(Cha Song Hwan Solo Exhibition: After-image And Reality)

00:45:20.590 --> 00:45:21.760
- Thank you. - Welcome.

00:45:22.760 --> 00:45:24.889
- Congratulations. - Thanks for coming. You're busy.

00:45:24.890 --> 00:45:26.659
- Thank you. - I came with a friend.

00:45:26.660 --> 00:45:27.930
These are amazing.

00:45:47.580 --> 00:45:48.620
You made it.

00:45:50.290 --> 00:45:51.320
What do you think of the exhibition?

00:45:53.760 --> 00:45:55.390
It's great. You did a good job.

00:45:57.990 --> 00:45:59.190
Do you still contact to Ji An?

00:46:02.160 --> 00:46:03.170
No.

00:46:04.570 --> 00:46:06.200
You know tomorrow is the anniversary of Dad's death, right?

00:46:09.340 --> 00:46:11.640
I guess it'll be hard for you to make it.

00:46:12.880 --> 00:46:14.140
So I'll have to go alone, right?

00:46:15.180 --> 00:46:16.350
I'm sorry, Eun Hwan.

00:46:18.380 --> 00:46:20.820
Even though I knew my unhappiness wasn't your fault,

00:46:22.120 --> 00:46:23.920
Back then, I needed someone to blame...

00:46:24.690 --> 00:46:26.360
Just to get through it.

00:46:27.860 --> 00:46:30.430
I really wanted to apologise to you.

00:46:31.560 --> 00:46:32.560
And...

00:46:33.830 --> 00:46:34.930
To Ji An too.

00:46:37.870 --> 00:46:39.100
I think...

00:46:40.600 --> 00:46:42.240
This answer is enough.

00:46:45.210 --> 00:46:46.540
Have a good visit to meet Dad tomorrow.

00:47:16.210 --> 00:47:19.370
(The Late Cha Woo Seok)

00:47:50.670 --> 00:47:51.670
No way.

00:47:53.740 --> 00:47:55.410
There's no way I can feel this.

00:47:57.450 --> 00:47:58.850
It's been over for ages.

00:48:02.320 --> 00:48:03.320
Yu Ji An.

00:48:05.890 --> 00:48:06.990
Where on earth are you?

00:48:08.260 --> 00:48:09.260
Please.

00:48:10.260 --> 00:48:11.630
Just appear in front of me.

